WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.089
Today we will use art to communicate a helpful message. Our work connects with

00:00:05.089 --> 00:00:06.835
Ghanaian and other African artists.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.409
Choose one clear message about a community need.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:16.665
Draw a bold image that supports the message. Record why your chosen technique suits

00:00:16.665 --> 00:00:17.375
the message.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.187
Add a few large readable words and check the layout.
